      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "sub_035_mgirl_01",
      "hash64": "4A602E61B3DEF66A",
      "text": "Vuoi che ti dica di che taglia sono i tuoi\\nPokémon?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sub_035_mgirl_02",
      "hash64": "4A602D61B3DEF4B7",
      "text": "Di quale Pokémon vuoi conoscere la taglia?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sub_035_mgirl_03",
      "hash64": "4A602C61B3DEF304",
      "text": "Il tuo [VAR 0x0102(0001)], eh? Dunque, vediamo...",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
